-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/WCF> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasBroaderPredominantAge> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Geochronology/Division/O> .
